WEBVTT

50:31.763 --> 50:34.725
Ned, see to it that your daughter
is disciplined.

50:34.850 --> 50:37.603
- I'll do the same with my son.
- Gladly, Your Grace.

50:38.937 --> 50:40.856
CERSEI: And what of the direwolf?

50:41.648 --> 50:44.067
What of the beast
that savaged your son?

50:47.154 --> 50:49.489
I'd forgot the damned wolf.

50:49.615 --> 50:52.284
We found no trace of the direwolf,
Your Grace.

50:52.409 --> 50:55.579
No? So be it.

50:55.704 --> 50:57.789
We have another wolf.
